# MiMenu runtime configuration
#
# The app stores menu, orders and CRM data in the browser (localStorage) and
# staff/waiter accounts in Cloudflare KV. No database URL or key is required.

# WebAR / AI 3D Pipeline (see docs/AR_PIPELINE.md)
# Frontend uses no extra env vars — data flows through /api/ar/* Functions.
# Cloudflare Pages secrets (Project: mimenu):
#   MESHY_API_KEY       Meshy AI key (required for /api/ar/generate)
#   AR_WORKER_TOKEN     shared worker secret (set)
#   AR_WORKER_URL       https://ar-worker.clubemkt.digital (set)
#   APP_SESSION_SECRET  HMAC secret for staff session tokens
#   RESEND_API_KEY      transactional email key
# VPS worker env: vps-worker/vps-worker.env (systemd unit: mimenu-ar-worker.service)
